      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TORNADO ETHICS (1) boasts a strong record this course with 10 wins and three minors from 20 tries. Missed the frame latest (20.10) when seventh over 350m at Goulburn in a NG. Appeals as a leading chance in this. KILCOY TIGER (2) was below best last time at Gosford (23.01) in a Grade 4/5, finishing a 9 length eighth. Unbeaten in two runs from this draw. With even luck and a clean start can sneak into the finish. MISS ARIZONA (5) is progressing well with another good run last time, placing (29.89) from Box 3 at Gosford. Has good early speed so she should be prominent despite the squeeze draw. Overdue and gets her chance. MIA ZIPPER (8) recorded a 0.8 lengths win (17.43) in a NG last time at Richmond Straight. Has already won five times from this draw.",
